# Version code, configuration and documentation. Root databases, circuits,
# runs and archives remain on disk outside the push list.
/*
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/rust-toolchain.toml
!/rustfmt.toml
!/pyproject.toml
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/.github/
!/configs/
!/src/
!/db_gen/
!/tests/
!/security_tests/
!/challenges/
!/benchmarks/
!/docs/
!/scripts/

# Build and interpreter output, including nested standalone tools.
**/target/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.rs.bk
*.pdb
**/mutants.out*/
.DS_Store

# Generated run output. Source scripts and Markdown remain visible to Git.
**/results/
**/outputs/
**/circuits/
**/work/
*.log
*.state
*.mpmct
*.sgc
*.esop
*.anf
*.lmdb
*.mdb
*.cnf
*.csv
*.zip

# Local configuration can contain paths, seeds or credentials.
/configs/local*.toml
/configs/*.local.toml

# Historical sync-conflict source copy; retained locally until reviewed.
/src/circuit/circuit 2.rs
